    "description": "esm-spec 11.4.4 'An initial condition of a parameter': a document written before 2.5.0 sets a parameter's value with an initialization equation (p ~ 5) or an ic equation (ic(q) ~ 2, replacing q's default 3). The loader moves each into the parameter's default and warns deprecated_field, so u = p + q = 7.",
